00:05:28.030 --> 00:05:29.190
They have some new Nike ones.

00:05:29.190 --> 00:05:32.020
They have a new Hermes black
band, which is so cool.

00:05:32.020 --> 00:05:33.120
It looks amazing.

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:34.720
But yeah, I went back to the ceramic.

00:05:34.720 --> 00:05:37.070
I had the ceramic years
ago and it still is just

00:05:37.070 --> 00:05:39.390
my favorite look, especially
if I get the silver phone.

00:05:39.390 --> 00:05:42.090
They're gonna match perfectly,
and I just, (breathes deeply)

00:05:42.090 --> 00:05:44.100
I said I can't wait because I,

00:05:44.100 --> 00:05:45.700
well, I guess I have to
wait, I don't have a choice.

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:47.700
But either way, it's
gonna be here so soon.

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:48.790
I would love to hear
from you guys, though.

00:05:48.790 --> 00:05:49.930
What did you think of the Event?

00:05:49.930 --> 00:05:51.190
Which phone was your favorite?

00:05:51.190 --> 00:05:52.440
Are you going to upgrade?

